      "sourceCredit": "ROSE, Richard & MACKIE, Thomas T. “Do parties persist or fail? The big trade-off facing organizations” in: LAWSON, Kay & MERKL, Peter (eds.). When parties fail. Princeton: Princeton University Press, 1988, p. 536. (Traduzido e adaptado)"
